id: evil-aura-controlled-darkness
name: Controlled Darkness
order: 4
slot: mastery
mastery: 1
# (1) A level of Rampaging less.
aspects: -Rampaging (LV1)
description: >
  The evil urges within you now answer to your beck and call.
text: >
  Controlled Darkness: The evil urges within you now answer to your beck and call.
  (1)-[Passive]: Reduce the level of the Rampaging Aspect by 1 level.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase this Transformation's Attribute Modifier Bonus (AG) by 1(T).
  (3)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Round]: You may spend 5(bT) Evil Points to gain an additional stack of Power.

